# #5837, the claimless advance and the split hint.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestFreeAdvanceIgnoresMarkerInit
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the free advance runs on an uninitialised marker, so it passes a straddler of the purged incarnation
PERTURBS: FreeCommit
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithRecreate = TRUE, WithUnclaimedSurvivor = FALSE, MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ ft[a] > rp[a]
    /\ mInit
    /\ ~hoOpen
    /\ rp[a] >= hoClosedAt - 1
    /\ rp[a] >= seenP[a]
--- REPLACE
    /\ ft[a] > rp[a]
\* MUTATION: an uninitialised marker does not hold the advance.
    /\ ~hoOpen
    /\ rp[a] >= hoClosedAt - 1
    /\ rp[a] >= seenP[a]
--- END
